// Piston - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// Piston is a sandbox for executing untrusted code, and what it stores
// per runtime is a JSON manifest: the runtime, the version it is
// built against, and the greeting as its one free-text field.
{
  "language": "hello",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Hello World!",
  "aliases": ["hello"]
}
